{"seq":3,"slug":"socket-programming","title":"Socket 编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/computer-networking/transport-layer/socket-programming","wordCount":718,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"socket-编程\">Socket 编程</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Socket 是操作系统暴露给应用的网络通信抽象：应用不再直接操作协议栈，而是通过一组文件描述符式的 API（<code>socket</code>/<code>bind</code>/<code>listen</code>/<code>accept</code>/<code>read</code>/<code>write</code>/<code>close</code>）来收发数据。它位于应用层与传输层之间，TCP 与 UDP 共用同一套接口，区别只在调用序列和语义。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    APP[应用层] --&gt; API[Socket API]&#10;    API --&gt; TCP[TCP: SOCK_STREAM 面向连接]&#10;    API --&gt; UDP[UDP: SOCK_DGRAM 数据报]&#10;    TCP --&gt; IO{并发模型}&#10;    IO --&gt; B[阻塞/一连接一线程]&#10;    IO --&gt; NB[非阻塞]&#10;    IO --&gt; MU[IO 多路复用 epoll/kqueue]\">graph TD\n    APP[应用层] --&gt; API[Socket API]\n    API --&gt; TCP[TCP: SOCK_STREAM 面向连接]\n    API --&gt; UDP[UDP: SOCK_DGRAM 数据报]\n    TCP --&gt; IO{并发模型}\n    IO --&gt; B[阻塞/一连接一线程]\n    IO --&gt; NB[非阻塞]\n    IO --&gt; MU[IO 多路复用 epoll/kqueue]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>关键 API / 概念</th>\n<th>本文对应小节</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>建立连接</td>\n<td>bind / listen / accept</td>\n<td>TCP Socket 通信流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收发数据</td>\n<td>read / write / sendto / recvfrom</td>\n<td>TCP / UDP 流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>防止线程阻塞</td>\n<td>非阻塞 + IO 多路复用</td>\n<td>IO 多路复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支撑高并发</td>\n<td>Reactor / Proactor</td>\n<td>经典并发模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解主线是&quot;从一次阻塞调用到数万并发连接&quot;：一连接一线程无法扩展，非阻塞 + epoll/kqueue 让单线程管理大量连接，Reactor 模式把事件分发与业务处理解耦——Nginx、Redis、Node.js 都建立在这个模型之上。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"socket-概述\">Socket 概述</h2><p>Socket（套接字）是操作系统提供的网络通信抽象接口，它封装了底层协议栈的细节，让应用程序可以通过简单的 API 进行网络通信。Socket 是连接应用层与传输层的桥梁。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"应用程序 A                              应用程序 B&#10;    │                                       │&#10;    ↓                                       ↓&#10; Socket API                             Socket API&#10;    │                                       │&#10;    ↓                                       ↓&#10; TCP/UDP                                TCP/UDP&#10;    │                                       │&#10;    ↓                                       ↓&#10;   IP ──────── 网络传输 ─────────────────→ IP\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>应用程序 A                              应用程序 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │                                       │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓                                       ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Socket API                             Socket API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │                                       │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓                                       ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> TCP/UDP                                TCP/UDP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │                                       │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓                                       ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   IP ──────── 网络传输 ─────────────────→ IP</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"tcp-socket-通信流程\">TCP Socket 通信流程</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"服务端                                    客户端&#10;  │                                         │&#10;  │ socket()     创建套接字                  │&#10;  │ bind()       绑定地址和端口              │&#10;  │ listen()     进入监听状态                │&#10;  │                                         │ socket()  创建套接字&#10;  │              ← 三次握手 →                │ connect() 发起连接&#10;  │ accept()     接受连接，返回新 socket      │&#10;  │                                         │&#10;  │ read/recv    ← 数据传输 →    write/send  │&#10;  │ write/send   → 数据传输 →    read/recv   │&#10;  │                                         │&#10;  │ close()      ← 四次挥手 →    close()     │&#10;  │                                         │\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>服务端                                    客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │                                         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ socket()     创建套接字                  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ bind()       绑定地址和端口              │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ listen()     进入监听状态                │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │                                         │ socket()  创建套接字</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │              ← 三次握手 →                │ connect() 发起连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ accept()     接受连接，返回新 socket      │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │                                         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ read/recv    ← 数据传输 →    write/send  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ write/send   → 数据传输 →    read/recv   │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │                                         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ close()      ← 四次挥手 →    close()     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │                                         │</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"tcp-服务端示例-c-语言\">TCP 服务端示例（C 语言）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"#include &lt;sys/socket.h&gt;&#10;#include &lt;netinet/in.h&gt;&#10;&#10;int main() {&#10;    int server_fd = socket(AF_INET, SOCK_STREAM, 0);&#10;&#10;    struct sockaddr_in addr = {&#10;        .sin_family = AF_INET,&#10;        .sin_addr.s_addr = INADDR_ANY,&#10;        .sin_port = htons(8080)&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    bind(server_fd, (struct sockaddr*)&amp;addr, sizeof(addr));&#10;    listen(server_fd, 128);&#10;&#10;    int client_fd = accept(server_fd, NULL, NULL);&#10;&#10;    char buf[1024];&#10;    ssize_t n = read(client_fd, buf, sizeof(buf));&#10;    write(client_fd, buf, n);&#10;&#10;    close(client_fd);&#10;    close(server_fd);&#10;    return 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;sys/socket.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;netinet/in.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> server_fd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> socket</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(AF_INET, SOCK_STREAM, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sockaddr_in addr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .sin_family </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AF_INET,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .sin_addr.s_addr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INADDR_ANY,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .sin_port </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> htons</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8080</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    bind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(server_fd, (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sockaddr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">addr, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(addr));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    listen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(server_fd, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client_fd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> accept</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(server_fd, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    char</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ssize_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(client_fd, buf, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(buf));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(client_fd, buf, n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(client_fd);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(server_fd);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"udp-socket-通信流程\">UDP Socket 通信流程</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"服务端                                    客户端&#10;  │                                         │&#10;  │ socket()     创建套接字                  │&#10;  │ bind()       绑定地址和端口              │ socket()  创建套接字&#10;  │                                         │&#10;  │ recvfrom()   ← 数据报 ←    sendto()     │&#10;  │ sendto()     → 数据报 →    recvfrom()   │&#10;  │                                         │&#10;  │ close()                     close()      │&#10;  │                                         │\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>服务端                                    客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │                                         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ socket()     创建套接字                  │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ bind()       绑定地址和端口              │ socket()  创建套接字</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │                                         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ recvfrom()   ← 数据报 ←    sendto()     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ sendto()     → 数据报 →    recvfrom()   │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │                                         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │ close()                     close()      │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │                                         │</span></span></code></pre></div><p>UDP 无需 listen/accept/connect，直接通过 sendto/recvfrom 传输数据报。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"阻塞-vs-非阻塞\">阻塞 vs 非阻塞</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>read() 行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阻塞</td>\n<td>无数据时挂起线程，直到数据到达</td>\n<td>简单场景，一连接一线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非阻塞</td>\n<td>无数据时立即返回 EAGAIN/EWOULDBLOCK</td>\n<td>高并发场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"int flags = fcntl(sockfd, F_GETFL, 0);&#10;fcntl(sockfd, F_SETFL, flags | O_NONBLOCK);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fcntl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sockfd, F_GETFL, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fcntl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sockfd, F_SETFL, flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> O_NONBLOCK);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"io-多路复用\">IO 多路复用</h2><p>IO 多路复用允许单个线程同时监听多个 Socket 的事件，是高并发服务器的核心技术。</p>\n<h3 id=\"select-poll-epoll-kqueue-对比\">select / poll / epoll / kqueue 对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>select</th>\n<th>poll</th>\n<th>epoll</th>\n<th>kqueue</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>macOS/BSD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大连接数</td>\n<td>1024 (FD_SETSIZE)</td>\n<td>无硬限制</td>\n<td>无硬限制</td>\n<td>无硬限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据结构</td>\n<td>fd_set 位图</td>\n<td>pollfd 数组</td>\n<td>红黑树+就绪链表</td>\n<td>kqueue 事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件触发</td>\n<td>水平触发</td>\n<td>水平触发</td>\n<td>水平/边缘触发</td>\n<td>水平/边缘触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每次调用复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fd 拷贝</td>\n<td>每次全量拷贝</td>\n<td>每次全量拷贝</td>\n<td>注册时拷贝一次</td>\n<td>注册时拷贝一次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"epoll-工作流程\">epoll 工作流程</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"int epfd = epoll_create1(0);&#10;&#10;struct epoll_event ev;&#10;ev.events = EPOLLIN;&#10;ev.data.fd = listen_fd;&#10;epoll_ctl(epfd, EPOLL_CTL_ADD, listen_fd, &amp;ev);&#10;&#10;struct epoll_event events[MAX_EVENTS];&#10;while (1) {&#10;    int nfds = epoll_wait(epfd, events, MAX_EVENTS, -1);&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; nfds; i++) {&#10;        if (events[i].data.fd == listen_fd) {&#10;            int conn_fd = accept(listen_fd, NULL, NULL);&#10;            ev.events = EPOLLIN | EPOLLET;&#10;            ev.data.fd = conn_fd;&#10;            epoll_ctl(epfd, EPOLL_CTL_ADD, conn_fd, &amp;ev);&#10;        } else {&#10;            handle_connection(events[i].data.fd);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> epfd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> epoll_create1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-